---
source: crates/djangofmt/tests/fmt/main.rs
---
<!-- Lowercasing property names is intentional.
     The `Margin` Outlook.com email hack doesn't warrant an option, `djangofmt:ignore` covers it. -->
<style>
    .a {
        margin: 0;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .b {
        /* djangofmt:ignore */
        Margin: 0;
        margin: 0;
    }
</style>
<td style="margin: 0; margin: 0">x</td>
